  "limitations": [
    "Large gains are concentrated on long shared intervals; no universal near-linear backward or universal speedup.",
    "Default exact search verifies full keys. Approximate full-channel FFT changes floating summation order; it is not an exact-output algorithm.",
    "Row sampling can exceed 100% raw Q/K error. Eight-channel sampling can fail under first-order cancellation.",
    "T4096 D64 12.74355x result covers 20 discovery-seed structural-stress updates; hard outputs/losses match but Q/K parameters differ from update one.",
    "A fresh seed makes channels8 slower and worse than full channels. Unretuned first-order prefix learning fails in all modes.",
    "Historical nonlinear stem training failed even for exact; arbitrary deep-network convergence remains unverified.",
    "Joint corner component replays are included; there is no extra whole-model forward and no change to the ordinary training loop.",
    "CPU implementation; CUDA tensors transfer to CPU. No GPU kernel throughput claim."
  ]
